"WING27 / サイドLED 16灯"
		(at 15.24 13.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.286 2.286))
			(justify left))
		(uuid "016cfec5-985b-5172-a52c-6132c1e569a3"))
	(text
"WS2812B-4020-V6：GPIO17 → R24 100Ω → DIN(1)。VDD(2)=VBUS、DOUT(3)、VSS(4)=GND。"
		(at 15.24 21.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left))
		(uuid "3ce24478-05f1-5091-8dcc-d83991b410e1"))
	(text
"各灯100nF / DIN・DOUTは実配線で連鎖。JP1〜16は通常OPEN、部品実装不要。"
		(at 15.24 28.575 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left))
		(uuid "6a0e1f74-6b9f-54ab-a038-a55b80e65004"))
	(text
"順序：左内4 → 左外4 → 右内4 → 右外4。図の左右は信号順を示す。基板の光向きは実装図で確認。"
		(at 15.24 267.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016))
			(justify left))
		(uuid "5140e8a9-e7c5-541b-b29e-e1b569b08d13"))
	(text
"途中のLEDを外す場合のみ、対応JPを短絡してDIN→DOUTをバイパスする。LED実装中は短絡しない。"
		(at 15.24 274.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016))
			(justify left))
		(uuid "bce9d573-db01-5136-af6f-e240a09a3ed7"))
	(embedded_fonts no))
